l7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"f43AIP_4AV2XSng0_LXI_A","review_id":"uf8S3ApNcMt1fdBHUoy5dQ","date":"2015-10-15T01:43:51","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9254526495933533,"text_excerpt":"After my experience with the location in NOLA East, I was fully expecting this Waffle House to be a mess. Not so; they were busy, but the staff was working together to make sure all customers were taken care of. We were promptly greeted upon sitting down and they quickly got everything cleaned up for us. My pecan waffle with chocolate chips was delicious, as were my hashbrowns with chili on top. When the new, fancy Waffle House on Canal opens I'll go there, but this one is great, literally right off the GNO."},{"business_id":"f43AIP_4AV2XSng0_LXI_A","review_id":"8dvIGDh7Id4Yzk2y-u0SJA","date":"2017-04-05T00:57:19","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9180787801742554,"text_excerpt":"Y'all know what Waffle House is food wise, so I will pass on giving you a soliloquy about it's merits and affordability. Let's jump straight to why I keep coming back to my favorite anytime of day or night cheap meal spot... The People! Every Waffle House I have ever been to is staffed with cooks/servers who really seem to enjoy their job, and it shows when they cut up with diners. We have fun conversations, joke about getting off the clock, and on one occasion collectively razzed a cook who didn't know what \"Super Sunday\" was in New Orleans. I can't think of another restaurant where I feel so comfortable and able to chat with my server and cooks. Having them just across the counter is a ..."},{"business_id":"f43AIP_4AV2XSng0_LXI_A","review_id":"0VhATsiWWraQ-8IRATuOvg","date":"2015-10-12T01:11:22","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9118738770484924,"text_excerpt":"I went here with a friend the other night because two other places we tried to go were closed. I am from Georgia where WaHo is much more common, they are literally everywhere. This was my first WaHo experience in Louisiana and I must say I was pleased. There was no wait for a table, the restaurant was clean, the service was good, the order correct, and everyone was friendly. I ordered the bacon, egg, and cheese melt which came with hash browns. Everything was really tasty and the portion size was generous in my opinion. They also let you pick from regular or Texas toast for you melt which is a nice touch. I went for the Texas toast and it was great. This place, like all WaHo's, is always ..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"f43AIP_4AV2XSng0_LXI_A","photo_id":"41URZRmzEIn9SI7uk8ihhw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/41URZRmzEIn9SI7uk8ihhw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9184494018554688},{"business_id":"f43AIP_4AV2XSng0_LXI_A","photo_id":"hktHTaCIiONKLC9nbiZx9w","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/hktHTaCIiONKLC9nbiZx9w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9168699383735657},{"business_id":"f43AIP_4AV2XSng0_LXI_A","photo_id":"NcjKxFHyizNQBl9iGauwdg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/NcjKxFHyizNQBl9iGauwdg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9087008237838745},{"business_id":"f43AIP_4AV2XSng0_LXI_A","photo_id":"KD3yYDXWv5j8qtQV_uEdIA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/KD3yYDXWv5j8qtQV_uEdIA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9031394124031067},{"business_id":"f43AIP_4AV2XSng0_LXI_A","photo_id":"t6B0Ifqnh83_tGXkwIF0hg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/t6B0Ifqnh83_tGXkwIF0hg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8777871131896973}]},"notebook_case":null}
